'''Vega Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Cat Capsules]] during the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 10.0 Update|version 10.0]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 578
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Vega Cat
|name2 = Vega Cat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Vega Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Vega Cat is an interesting cat, with the rare niche of strong against Angels and most importantly, immune to toxic, making him a toxic immune meatshield, which is very hard to come by. Thus, this means he is effective against enemies like [[Gobble]], [[Zollow]], and [[Heavenly Herald Papuu|Papuu]], which most traditional Cats fail against. Despite his good niche, it still isn't enough to cover his weakness of low health. At level 30 he has a miniscule 10,000 health, which is not enough to tank any form of hit from any lategame enemy, which is his place of usage. This is further weakened by the fact that despite most toxic enemies having low damage, Vega Cat lacks enough base stats to successfully use his role.

{{Job|Classification=Meatshield}}

